OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA partly cloudy day with the
OL,6,Fodd shower possible, mostly close to
OL,7,Fcoasts, which could be wintry at times
OL,8,Facross higher ground. Staying rather
OL,9,Fcold inland and breezier than Saturday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining largely dry with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells.
OL,13,FChance of wintry showers, mainly near
OL,14,Fcoastal parts. Light winds allowing
OL,15,Ftemperatures to fall, with frost
OL,16,Fdeveloping in many places.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FAnother mainly dry day with
OL,19,Fvariable cloud and some bright or
OL,20,Fsunny spells. Remaining rather cold
OL,21,Fwith generally light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
